# 基本文章編集の〈ウインドウ幅で折り返し〉と、開いた元の仮身への書き戻し (design 11.3), for
# tools/ui_run.py. A copy of 基本文章編集 with 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30) is linked into
# BTRON (linkbig) and opened by a double press on its link, once in the desktop's own text
# editor (docproc kernel) and once in the text editor running as a process (docproc 1). The
# wrapping to the window is turned off from 表示 in the menu opened at 300,250 and the window
# closed: the view goes back into the link, its wordWrap with it (the process asks
# DT_RQ_LINK_VIEW with look.h). Opened again from the same link by the same editor -- the
# process is given the link as BTRON's record holds it, not yet saved (T_PRCOPEN) -- the
# window shows the text wrapped to its paper, as the link now says. The shots (doc_wrap_k_*, doc_wrap_p_*) are
# compared afterwards inside the window, where the text is (101,125 to 682,482); record 0 of
# the text is the same in both (nothing in it changed).
# The desktop's menu opens with 閉じる on the pointer's row the first time (表示 60 below),
# and with the item chosen last on it afterwards; 表示's own opens with its first row (原稿)
# on 表示's row, 〈ウインドウ幅で折り返し〉 180 below.
# Keys: Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
mkbig doc 30
linkbig 190 70
wait 300
dclick 200 79
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_wrap_k_open
click 300 250 1
wait 400
wait 400
move 330 310
wait 300
move 440 310
wait 400
move 440 490
wait 300
click 440 490
sync 600
click 111 135
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_wrap_k_off
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
dclick 200 79
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
move 690 490
sync 600
shot doc_wrap_k_again
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
docproc 1
mkbig doc 30
linkbig 190 100
wait 300
logmark
dclick 200 109
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_wrap_p_open
logmark
click 300 250 1
expectsince document: menu
wait 400
move 330 250
wait 300
move 440 250
wait 400
move 440 430
wait 300
click 440 430
expectsince document: command wrap
expectsince document: drew
logmark
click 111 135
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_wrap_p_off
sum show
same kernel
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: link view 0,0 0% (0) nowrap
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
logmark
dclick 200 109
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_wrap_p_again
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
